4	// network filter is active. normalize_chunked_test.go pins the same
5	// delivery-shape invariants for the unfiltered entry point; this file pins
6	// them for NormalizeReaderFiltered with a non-nil filter, so the read
7	// pattern can never change what the filter admits:
